{"id":395,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知性と自主自立を育てる南高附属","feature_description":"南高等学校附属中学校は、教育理念を「知性・自主自立・創造」とし、6年間の一貫教育で国際社会で活躍するリーダーを育てる学校です。教育方針では、飽くなき探究心、自ら考えて行動する力、未来を切り拓く力を掲げています。部活動も平日基準で整い、学校生活の柱になっています。中高一貫の連続性を重視しています。附属中の一年間も見通しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":7401,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7402,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7403,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7404,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7405,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7406,"name":"バドミントン（1年女子　2、3年男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7407,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7408,"name":"ハンドボール（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7409,"name":"硬式テニス（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7410,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-minami/index.cfm/1,0,68,html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7411,"name":"茶道","